  text: Monitor and track FMLA and leave of absence documentation in partnership with the HR team
  text: Partner with HR Business Partners, Finance, and People Operations on projects and process improvements
  text: Assist with onboarding new hires by conducting benefits orientations and ensuring timely enrollment
  text: Generate standard and ad hoc payroll and benefits reports for internal stakeholders
# What we’re looking for
  text: 1-2 years of experience in payroll processing and benefits administration
  text: Hands-on experience in ADP or comparable HRIS
  text: Familiarity with employment laws, leave regulations, and benefits compliance
  text: Proficiency in Excel / Google Sheets and comfort with HR technology
  text: Excellent attention to detail, organization, and follow-through
  text: Strong communication and customer service skills are a must
  text: Ability to handle confidential data professionally and with discretion
